## Why This Is Asked

This question evaluates system design expertise for real-time, privacy-preserving machine learning at scale, requiring careful balance between latency constraints, hardware heterogeneity, and cross-modal fusion capabilities.

## Key Concepts

- Hardware-aware model architecture with mixed-precision optimization
- Early-exit strategies and multi-modal feature fusion
- Dynamic batching and latency budget management
- Federated learning with privacy-preserving updates
- Model drift detection and continuous calibration

## Code Example

```javascript
function forward(x){
  const encoder = sharedEncoder(x);
  const confidence = calculateConfidence(encoder);

  if (confidence > threshold) {
    return earlyExit(encoder);
  }

  const features = modalityFusion(encoder);
  return finalClassification(features);
}
```

